Optional Word export uses pypandoc-binary (MIT wrapper) and its bundled
Pandoc executable, distributed separately under Pandoc's own license.
See https://github.com/JessicaTegner/pypandoc and
https://github.com/jgm/pandoc/blob/main/COPYING.md.

